    "detailed_description": "This game was created with Unity based on the Unity &quot;Platformer Microgame&quot; project<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJumping Platform Minigame is a 2D platform game in which you have to collect diamonds and kill small mushrooms.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 10 Levels<br />\r\n- You can play with the keyboard and the joystick<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls<br />\r\n- A-D or arrow keys / left analog stick (move the player)<br />\r\n- Space / button &quot;A&quot; xbox (jump)<br />\r\n- Esc / button &quot;start&quot; xbox (pause game)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNOTE : Don't use the joystick in the game menu (controls / credits), the player doesn't jump anymore.<br />\r\nNOTE : Don't use the Steam overlay unless you pause the game first.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGOOD FUN !!!",
